      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The untreated CrMnFeCoNi bond coat forms an uneven, non-protective Mn-rich oxide scale.",
      "field": "baseline",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10384371::web::015::3_2_htxrd_in_vacuum",
        "PMC10384371::web::027::4_3_oxidation_in_air"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The absence of a protective oxide barrier in CrMnFeCoNi permits outward Mn diffusion and Mn3O4 formation near 950°C in air.",
      "field": "baseline",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10384371::web::027::4_3_oxidation_in_air"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed intervention is incorporation of 5 at.% Al into the CrMnFeCoNi bond coat.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Adding 5 at.% Al to CrMnFeCoNi will produce a continuous, dense, and adherent Al2O3 scale during initial high-temperature exposure.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10384371::web::027::4_3_oxidation_in_air"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Al-containing high-temperature alloys can form Al2O3 as a protective oxide barrier.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10384371::web::027::4_3_oxidation_in_air"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Al will preferentially oxidize within the Al-modified CrMnFeCoNi matrix.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10384371::web::027::4_3_oxidation_in_air"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The resulting alumina scale will impede oxygen ingress and improve oxidation resistance.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10384371::web::027::4_3_oxidation_in_air"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The alumina barrier will suppress uncontrolled manganese oxidation.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10384371::web::027::4_3_oxidation_in_air"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Formation of the alumina scale will reduce thermal-expansion mismatch.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Reduced thermal-expansion mismatch will limit crack initiation and spallation during thermal cycling.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The 5 at.% Al-modified bond coat will exhibit significantly less oxidation-induced spallation than untreated CrMnFeCoNi.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The 5 at.% Al-modified bond coat will have greater thermal-fatigue resistance than untreated CrMnFeCoNi.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The 5 at.% Al modification will improve overall coating durability and reliability during prolonged high-temperature cycling.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10384371::web::027::4_3_oxidation_in_air"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The protective effect will persist during cyclic oxidation around 1000°C.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "An Al concentration substantially below 5 at.% may be insufficient to form a continuous alumina scale.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "An Al concentration substantially above 5 at.% may cause phase instabilities that compromise protection.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
